 *
 * Matches `claude-{family}-{major}-{minor}[-{date}]` (the convention used
 * for every Claude model family to date) and renders e.g.
 *   claude-opus-4-7            -> "Opus 4.7"
 *   claude-haiku-4-5-20251001  -> "Haiku 4.5"
 *   claude-sonnet-4-6          -> "Sonnet 4.6"
